  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The woman's suffering is mapped as the reason for women's demand for equal rights",
  "description": "The text 'women ask for equal rights, and this is why' explicitly maps the visual entity 'woman_with_injuries_and_text' (specifically her injuries and suffering) as the causal or explanatory reason for the demand for equal rights. The visual material (the injured woman) is presented as the direct analogical representation of the textual claim (the 'why' behind the demand). This mapping is reinforced by the juxtaposition of the text with the image of trauma, creating a direct analogy: 'the suffering of this woman = the reason why women ask for equal rights'.",
